    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "issue": "The final word is printed ἐξαυτῆς, including ξ and final ῆς, not ἑαυτῷ."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "issue": "The image reads ἀκμαζούσῃ, not ἀκαλούσῃ."
    }
